WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.354 --> 00:00:02.277
Policy and enforcement

2
00:00:02.294 --> 00:00:05.311
Declaring rules proving they are wired

3
00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:07.108
and reproducing a finding

4
00:00:08.294 --> 00:00:11.181
A rule is not enforced because it is

5
00:00:10.781 --> 00:00:11.910
written down

6
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.019
It is enforced when it is declared

7
00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:14.944
validated

8
00:00:14.999 --> 00:00:16.662
wired into a command

9
00:00:16.653 --> 00:00:18.082
fails that command

10
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:21.675
is tested blocks CI and backs a claim

11
00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:24.188
Anything less is documentation

12
00:00:25.378 --> 00:00:27.848
And the repository checks itself

13
00:00:27.852 --> 00:00:31.611
Majordomus doctor reads every rule every

14
00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:33.382
projection and every hook

15
00:00:33.451 --> 00:00:35.088
on every commit

16
00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:36.989
Forty-four blocking rules

17
00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:38.655
each with a validator

18
00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:40.205
Zero failures

19
00:00:41.406 --> 00:00:42.834
Two hooks hold the line

20
00:00:42.851 --> 00:00:45.100
Every commit runs doctor

21
00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:48.030
Every push runs the finish contract and

22
00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:50.451
an unmet one stops the push

23
00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:53.290
Until the first task starts both stay

24
00:00:52.903 --> 00:00:53.876
quiet

25
00:00:55.058 --> 00:00:56.890
Install it with one line

26
00:00:56.907 --> 00:00:59.064
Initialise your repository

27
00:00:59.094 --> 00:01:01.057
Then start a task with a scope

28
00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:02.632
and let your agents work
